    { "name": "بیش‌پرداختِ کیف پول رد می‌شود", "input": { "total": 100000, "tenders": [{ "method": "hesabpay", "amount": 120000, "ref": "H" }] },
      "expect": { "ok": false, "error": "NON_CASH_OVERPAY" } },
    { "name": "همه با کیف پول؛ نقدِ اضافه کاملاً پس داده می‌شود", "input": { "total": 100000, "tenders": [{ "method": "hesabpay", "amount": 100000, "ref": "H" }, { "method": "cash", "amount": 5000 }] },
      "expect": { "ok": true, "status": "paid", "total": 100000, "rounding": 0, "due": 100000, "tendered": 105000, "change": 5000, "remaining": 0, "toAccount": 0,
